# ####################################################################################
# # BARD THROWING
# ####################################################################################
# Naming convention
#   config__*  : tunable settings, kept at the top of the file
#   wait__*    : how long the script sleeps or waits for a target cursor
#   cooldown__*: thresholds compared against a timer__ or a named cooldown
#   var__*     : state owned by this script
#   alias__*   : result of an as binding from find / findtype
#   label__*   : result of getlabel
#   timer__*   : createtimer / settimer target
#   words are snake_case, the prefix is split off with a double underscore
#
# warmode policy
#   warmode ON is the manual control window, so barding stands down there.
#   disco / peace / virtuoso only run while warmode is OFF.
#   codex stance and weapon ability ignore warmode: a stance is a passive mode, and the
#   ability gauge fills whether or not the player drives the fight by hand.
#
# Literal policy
#   wait / waitfortarget / settimer / cooldown / lift amount / comparison right-hand sides
#   and the findtype aspect hue are lifted to variables.
#   find and findtype source / quantity / range and overhead hue stay numeric literals.
#
# Overhead policy
#   A resource or gear problem leads with the noun, so it reads at a glance.
#   A line that echoes a game event keeps the game's own sentence.
#   No exclamation marks.
#   Hue carries the category. The values sit one step apart on the UO message hue ladder,
#   so no two categories share a colour family:
#     33  red     act on this right now
#     43  orange  a resource or a piece of gear is missing
#     53  yellow  moving throw count      (profile agent, see below)
#     63  green   a potion was just consumed, kept to two lines so green stays rare
#     73  aqua    neutral information, prompts and planted
#     88  blue    a special effect fired  (profile agent, see below)
#
# Throw status readout
#   The moving throw count, the planted reload and the wing proc are printed by Razor's
#   Overhead Messages agent in the profile, not by this script. They are pure display with
#   no logic attached, and reading them here meant competing for the system message buffer.
#   The agent watches the journal instead, so the readout does not depend on what this
#   script does with the buffer at all.
#   Entries live under <overheadmessages> in the Razor profile, hues as listed above.
#
# System message buffer
#   Nothing clears the buffer once the loop is running. The two clearsysmsg left are both in
#   the setup above the loop, and replay reruns them. The bard blocks used to clear it
#   before each useskill to keep a stale instrument prompt out of their own check, but that
#   prompt only appears when the instrument is invalid, and then the useskill fails the same
#   way and leaves no target cursor for a stale line to hijack. Clearing cost more than it
#   saved: it wiped the planted line mid fight. The check at the top of the loop drains the
#   prompt every pass, which is the real guard.

clearsysmsg
clearall
clearignore
cleardragdrop

# ####################################################################################
# # CONFIG
# ####################################################################################
@setvar! config__use_potion 1
@setvar! config__use_bard_song 1
@setvar! config__use_weapon_ability 1

# Planted window readout. 1 prints the elapsed time over your head after a planted,
# so you can see how much of the 10 second moving throw window is left.
@setvar! config__show_planted_timer 1

# Magic item mode. 1 looks for a magic suffix on the label, 0 takes the first match and
# skips getlabel entirely, which is the cheaper path when training with plain gear.
@setvar! config__use_magic_weapon 0
@setvar! config__use_magic_instrument 0

# Aspect hue the weapon search filters on. Change this one value when the aspect changes.
# NOTE: the repo has no precedent for a variable in the findtype hue slot. If the weapon
# stops being found after this change, put 2241 back inline in the two findtype lines.
# 2241 - lyric , 2767 - earth
@setvar! config__aspect_hue 2767

# Codex stance and weapon ability. The slot numbers follow the codex list order, so if the
# in game order differs only these five numbers change.
@setvar! config__use_codex_stance 1
@setvar! config__stance_torrent 1
@setvar! config__stance_suppress 2
@setvar! config__stance_reaper 3
@setvar! config__stance_rake 4
@setvar! config__stance_kite 5
@setvar! config__ability_clash 1
@setvar! config__ability_blitz 2

# Suppress latches on above the enter line and only releases below the leave line, so the
# stance cannot flap while bandages tick. Both are hit deficit, not percent: this repo has
# no precedent for arithmetic inside a condition.
@setvar! config__suppress_enter_diff 60
@setvar! config__suppress_leave_diff 48

# Survival thresholds
@setvar! config__heal_potion_diff 40
@setvar! config__heal_skill_min 10
@setvar! config__stam_threshold 80
@setvar! config__str_threshold 100
@setvar! config__dex_threshold 100
@setvar! config__gold_drop_amount 500

# ####################################################################################
# # WAIT AND COOLDOWN
# ####################################################################################
# Every value is milliseconds.
# wait__short absorbed the old 100 poll and 200 settle, wait__target the old 500 and 1000
# target waits, so a whole class of delay can be tuned from one line.
# cooldown__ names mirror what they feed, so
# settimer "timer__overhead_message" cooldown__overhead_message reads as one pair.
@setvar! wait__short 200
@setvar! wait__long 1000
@setvar! wait__target 1000
@setvar! cooldown__overhead_message 2700
@setvar! cooldown__combat_target_grace 1200
@setvar! cooldown__heal_potion 10000
# The Clash / Blitz / Hail Mary gauge refills in 24 to 60 seconds, so one minute is the
# safe spacing. Shorter only wastes chat lines, it cannot fire the ability early.
@setvar! cooldown__ability 60000
@setvar! cooldown__stance_retry 3000
@setvar! cooldown__stance_resync 30000
# Planted lasts 10 seconds from the moment it is gained and does not refresh while you
# stand, so these are absolute marks on one window, not a repeating tick.
@setvar! cooldown__planted_2 2000
@setvar! cooldown__planted_4 4000
@setvar! cooldown__planted_6 6000
@setvar! cooldown__planted_8 8000
@setvar! cooldown__planted_10 10000

# ####################################################################################
# # TIMER
# ####################################################################################
if not timerexists "timer__overhead_message"
    createtimer "timer__overhead_message"
endif

settimer "timer__overhead_message" cooldown__overhead_message

if not timerexists "timer__combat_target_grace"
    createtimer "timer__combat_target_grace"
endif

settimer "timer__combat_target_grace" cooldown__combat_target_grace

if not timerexists "timer__stance_retry"
    createtimer "timer__stance_retry"
endif

settimer "timer__stance_retry" cooldown__stance_retry

if not timerexists "timer__stance_resync"
    createtimer "timer__stance_resync"
endif

settimer "timer__stance_resync" 0

if not timerexists "timer__planted"
    createtimer "timer__planted"
endif

# Starts past the last mark so a fresh run prints nothing until a planted is seen.
settimer "timer__planted" cooldown__planted_10

# ####################################################################################
# # STATE
# ####################################################################################
if not varexist var__my_weapon
    @setvar! var__my_weapon 0
endif

if not varexist var__my_instrument
    @setvar! var__my_instrument 0
endif

if not varexist var__combat_target
    @setvar! var__combat_target 0
endif

# Starts on Rake so the dead band between the two Suppress lines has a defined answer on
# the very first pass. var__stance_active 0 means unknown, which forces a label read.
if not varexist var__stance_want
    @setvar! var__stance_want config__stance_rake
endif

if not varexist var__stance_active
    @setvar! var__stance_active 0
endif

if not varexist var__ability_want
    @setvar! var__ability_want 0
endif

# 0 to 4 are the marks still to print, 5 means the window is done and nothing prints.
if not varexist var__planted_step
    @setvar! var__planted_step 5
endif

# Latched to 1 when the codex label turns out to name no stance at all. Switching blind is
# unsafe because the codex button is a toggle, so the feature stands down instead.
if not varexist var__stance_disabled
    @setvar! var__stance_disabled 0
endif

# ####################################################################################
# # INSTRUMENT
# ####################################################################################
# Only auto detect when the cached instrument is no longer in the backpack.
if not find var__my_instrument backpack
    @setvar! var__my_instrument 0

    if config__use_magic_instrument = 1
        while findtype 3740|3742|3762|3763|10245|20006|20008|20010|20012|20014|20016 backpack as alias__found_magic_instrument
            getlabel alias__found_magic_instrument label__found_magic_instrument

            if "supremely" in label__found_magic_instrument or "exceedingly" in label__found_magic_instrument
                @setvar! var__my_instrument alias__found_magic_instrument
                break
            endif

            @ignore alias__found_magic_instrument
        endwhile

        @clearignore
    else
        if findtype 3740|3742|3762|3763|10245|20006|20008|20010|20012|20014|20016 backpack as alias__found_craft_instrument
            @setvar! var__my_instrument alias__found_craft_instrument
        endif
    endif
endif

# If auto detect fails, ask for a manual pick exactly once.
if not find var__my_instrument backpack
    clearsysmsg
    overhead "Select instrument:" 73
    @setvar! var__my_instrument
    wait wait__long

    if find var__my_instrument backpack as alias__picked_instrument
        getlabel alias__picked_instrument label__picked_instrument

        if "flute" in label__picked_instrument or "drums" in label__picked_instrument or "harp" in label__picked_instrument or "lute" in label__picked_instrument or "tambourine" in label__picked_instrument or "gemshorn" in label__picked_instrument or "hurdy" in label__picked_instrument or "psaltery" in label__picked_instrument or "sackbut" in label__picked_instrument or "shawm" in label__picked_instrument or "vielle" in label__picked_instrument
            overhead "{{label__picked_instrument}}" 73
            dclick var__my_instrument
            wait wait__long
        else
            @setvar! var__my_instrument 0
            overhead "Not an instrument" 33
            stop
        endif
    else
        @setvar! var__my_instrument 0
        overhead "Not in backpack" 33
        stop
    endif
endif

# ####################################################################################
# # MAIN LOOP
# ####################################################################################
while not dead
    while queued
        wait wait__short
    endwhile

    while casting
        wait wait__short
    endwhile

    # ################################################################################
    # # WEAPON
    # ################################################################################
    # 67734 / hurlbat
    # The throwing weapon is one handed and takes righthand, so the parrying gauche in the
    # SHIELD block below can hold lefthand. This is the bard-archer.razor layout, not the
    # bard-mace.razor one, where a two handed staff sits in lefthand on its own.
    # Re-scan when the cache is empty or the weapon is gone.
    if rhandempty
        if not find var__my_weapon backpack
            @setvar! var__my_weapon 0

            if config__use_magic_weapon = 1
                while findtype 67734 backpack config__aspect_hue as alias__found_magic_weapon
                    getlabel alias__found_magic_weapon label__found_magic_weapon

                    if "vanquishing" in label__found_magic_weapon or "power" in label__found_magic_weapon or "force" in label__found_magic_weapon or "might" in label__found_magic_weapon
                        @setvar! var__my_weapon alias__found_magic_weapon
                        break
                    endif

                    @ignore alias__found_magic_weapon
                endwhile

                @clearignore
            else
                # Plain mode takes the first hurlbat at the aspect hue without reading its label.
                if findtype 67734 backpack config__aspect_hue as alias__found_craft_weapon
                    @setvar! var__my_weapon alias__found_craft_weapon
                endif
            endif
        endif

        if find var__my_weapon backpack as alias__equip_weapon
            lift alias__equip_weapon
            drop self righthand
            wait wait__long
        else
            if timer "timer__overhead_message" > cooldown__overhead_message
                overhead "No throwing weapon in backpack." 43
                settimer "timer__overhead_message" 0
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # SHIELD
    # ################################################################################
    # 31002 / parrying gauche, listed under Shields in library/item-list.razor:1080.
    # Matched on graphic with no hue filter so a plain gauche still equips, and no cache is
    # kept because this path never calls getlabel.
    if lhandempty
        if findtype 31002 backpack as alias__equip_shield
            lift alias__equip_shield
            drop self lefthand
            wait wait__long
        else
            if timer "timer__overhead_message" > cooldown__overhead_message
                overhead "No parrying gauche in backpack." 43
                settimer "timer__overhead_message" 0
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # SYSTEM MESSAGE
    # ################################################################################
    # insysmsg consumes the matched message and everything before it, so check order matters.
    # replay restarts the whole script from line 1, which also runs the clearsysmsg at the
    # top, so a false match here is expensive. Nothing else in this file reads the system
    # message buffer for display, so these three checks never have to share it.
    if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
        replay
    endif

    if insysmsg "That is not a musical instrument"
        @setvar! var__my_instrument 0
        overhead "Instrument invalid, reselecting." 33
        replay
    endif

    if insysmsg "What instrument shall you play"
        waitfortarget wait__target

        if targetexists
            target var__my_instrument
            replay
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # PLANTED WINDOW
    # ################################################################################
    # Planted opens a 10 second window and does not refresh while you keep standing, so the
    # moving throws are gone at 10 seconds whether or not you spent them. Standing still
    # again only starts a new 3 second charge. This block reports the elapsed time so the
    # window is visible. Nothing else reads the timer or the step.
    #
    # Sits directly under the instrument checks, where the old throw status block sat, so a
    # clearsysmsg further down the loop cannot wipe the planted line before it is read.
    # var__planted_step locks each mark, so a mark prints once and the pass after a planted
    # cannot reprint an earlier one.
    if config__show_planted_timer = 1
        if insysmsg "now planted"
            settimer "timer__planted" 0
            @setvar! var__planted_step 0
        endif

        if var__planted_step = 0 and timer "timer__planted" >= cooldown__planted_2
            overhead "Planted 2s." 73
            @setvar! var__planted_step 1
        endif

        if var__planted_step = 1 and timer "timer__planted" >= cooldown__planted_4
            overhead "Planted 4s." 73
            @setvar! var__planted_step 2
        endif

        if var__planted_step = 2 and timer "timer__planted" >= cooldown__planted_6
            overhead "Planted 6s." 73
            @setvar! var__planted_step 3
        endif

        if var__planted_step = 3 and timer "timer__planted" >= cooldown__planted_8
            overhead "Planted 8s." 73
            @setvar! var__planted_step 4
        endif

        if var__planted_step = 4 and timer "timer__planted" >= cooldown__planted_10
            overhead "Moving throws gone." 33
            @setvar! var__planted_step 5
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # COMBAT TARGET CACHE
    # ################################################################################
    # Cache the last hostile target so targeting the backpack or self does not break the combat logic.
    if find lasttarget ground -1 -1 12 as alias__fresh_target
        if not dead alias__fresh_target and var__combat_target != alias__fresh_target
            if noto alias__fresh_target = "hostile" or noto alias__fresh_target = "criminal" or noto alias__fresh_target = "enemy" or noto alias__fresh_target = "murderer"
                @setvar! var__combat_target alias__fresh_target
                settimer "timer__combat_target_grace" 0
            endif
        endif
    endif

    if find var__combat_target ground -1 -1 12 as alias__stored_target
        if dead alias__stored_target
            @setvar! var__combat_target 0
        elseif noto alias__stored_target != "hostile" and noto alias__stored_target != "criminal" and noto alias__stored_target != "enemy" and noto alias__stored_target != "murderer"
            @setvar! var__combat_target 0
        else
            settimer "timer__combat_target_grace" 0
        endif
    elseif var__combat_target != 0 and timer "timer__combat_target_grace" >= cooldown__combat_target_grace
        @setvar! var__combat_target 0
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # OVERWEIGHT
    # ################################################################################
    while weight > maxweight
        if findtype "gold coin" backpack as alias__found_gold
            lift alias__found_gold config__gold_drop_amount
            droprelloc 0 0
            wait wait__short

            if insysmsg "cannot drop anything"
                drop backpack -1 -1 -1
            endif

            wait wait__long
            overhead "You drop some gold on the ground." 73
        else
            if timer "timer__overhead_message" > cooldown__overhead_message
                overhead "Overweight, no gold to drop." 43
                settimer "timer__overhead_message" 0
            endif

            break
        endif
    endwhile

    # ################################################################################
    # # FOOD
    # ################################################################################
    if not findbuff 'Food Satisfaction'
        if findtype tray backpack as alias__found_food
            dclick alias__found_food
            wait wait__short
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # BANDAGE
    # ################################################################################
    if diffhits > 0 or poisoned
        if not bandaging and skill "Healing" > config__heal_skill_min
            if findtype "clean bandage%s%" self
                hotkey "Bandage Self"
                wait wait__short
            else
                if timer "timer__overhead_message" > cooldown__overhead_message
                    overhead "No bandages left." 43
                    settimer "timer__overhead_message" 0
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # PARALYZE POUCH
    # ################################################################################
    if paralyzed
        if findtype 3705 backpack 38
            yell "[Pouch"
            wait wait__short
        else
            if timer "timer__overhead_message" > cooldown__overhead_message
                overhead "No pouches left." 43
                settimer "timer__overhead_message" 0
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # HEAL POT
    # ################################################################################
    if diffhits >= config__heal_potion_diff and config__use_potion = 1 and not targetexists
        if findtype "Yellow Potion" self as alias__heal_potion
            getlabel alias__heal_potion label__heal_potion

            if "next usable" in label__heal_potion
                if timer "timer__overhead_message" > cooldown__overhead_message
                    overhead label__heal_potion 73
                    settimer "timer__overhead_message" 0
                endif
            else
                overhead "You drink a healing potion." 63
                dclick alias__heal_potion
                wait wait__short
                cooldown "Heal Potion" cooldown__heal_potion
            endif
        else
            if timer "timer__overhead_message" > cooldown__overhead_message
                overhead "No healing potions left." 43
                settimer "timer__overhead_message" 0
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # CURE POT
    # ################################################################################
    # While hidden, skip only the potion. The old break terminated the whole main loop.
    if poisoned and config__use_potion = 1 and not targetexists and not hidden
        if findtype "Orange Potion" self as alias__cure_potion
            overhead "You drink a cure potion." 63
            dclick alias__cure_potion
            wait wait__short
        else
            if timer "timer__overhead_message" > cooldown__overhead_message
                overhead "No cure potions left." 43
                settimer "timer__overhead_message" 0
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # STAMINA POT
    # ################################################################################
    # Total Refresh has no cooldown, so keep drinking below the threshold.
    if stam < config__stam_threshold and config__use_potion = 1 and not targetexists
        if findtype "Red Potion" backpack as alias__refresh_potion
            dclick alias__refresh_potion
            wait wait__short
        else
            if timer "timer__overhead_message" > cooldown__overhead_message
                overhead "No refresh potions left." 43
                settimer "timer__overhead_message" 0
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # STRENGTH POT
    # ################################################################################
    if not findbuff 'Strength' and str <= config__str_threshold and config__use_potion = 1 and not targetexists and find var__combat_target ground -1 -1 12
        if findtype "White Potion" backpack as alias__strength_potion
            dclick alias__strength_potion
            wait wait__short
        else
            if timer "timer__overhead_message" > cooldown__overhead_message
                overhead "No strength potions left." 43
                settimer "timer__overhead_message" 0
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # AGILITY POT
    # ################################################################################
    if not findbuff 'Agility' and dex <= config__dex_threshold and config__use_potion = 1 and not targetexists and find var__combat_target ground -1 -1 12
        if findtype "Blue Potion" backpack as alias__agility_potion
            dclick alias__agility_potion
            wait wait__short
        else
            if timer "timer__overhead_message" > cooldown__overhead_message
                overhead "No agility potions left." 43
                settimer "timer__overhead_message" 0
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # RESIST POT
    # ################################################################################
    if not findbuff 'Magic Resist Potion' and config__use_potion = 1 and not targetexists and find var__combat_target ground -1 -1 12
        if findtype "Black Potion" backpack as alias__resist_potion
            dclick alias__resist_potion
            wait wait__short
        else
            if timer "timer__overhead_message" > cooldown__overhead_message
                overhead "No magic resist potions left." 43
                settimer "timer__overhead_message" 0
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # CODEX STANCE
    # ################################################################################
    # Rake is the default because its damage bonus doubles on a Moving Throw, which is what
    # this script throws most of the time. Suppress takes over while hurt: it trades damage
    # for a damage resistance buff that every weapon swing refreshes.
    # Torrent, Reaper and Kite are deliberately never selected: the stance numbers are on
    # the wiki, Weapon_and_Parry_Codex, and Torrent resets its stack every 5 hits.
    #
    # The codex label is the only source of truth. Outlands announces a stance change as an
    # OVERHEAD message, not a system message: every "stance activated" trigger in the Razor
    # cooldown definitions is an OverheadMessage, and insysmsg cannot read those. So the
    # cache is refreshed from the label on a timer, which also catches a hand switch.
    #
    # No warmode gate. A stance is a passive mode, it does not care whether the player is
    # driving the fight by hand. It does carry a not pvp gate: getlabel is on the Outlands
    # PvP restriction list, and a restricted label would read as "no stance name" and latch
    # the feature off for the rest of the run. This script is not a PvP script.
    #
    # Sits after the survival blocks on purpose: the getlabel below costs a server round
    # trip and must never delay a bandage or a heal potion.
    if config__use_codex_stance = 1 and var__stance_disabled = 0 and not pvp
        # Drop the cache periodically so a stance changed by hand is picked up.
        if timer "timer__stance_resync" > cooldown__stance_resync
            @setvar! var__stance_active 0
            settimer "timer__stance_resync" 0
        endif

        if diffhits > config__suppress_enter_diff
            @setvar! var__stance_want config__stance_suppress
        elseif diffhits < config__suppress_leave_diff
            @setvar! var__stance_want config__stance_rake
        endif

        if var__stance_want != var__stance_active and timer "timer__stance_retry" > cooldown__stance_retry
            settimer "timer__stance_retry" 0

            if findtype 11903 backpack as alias__throwing_codex
                getlabel alias__throwing_codex label__throwing_codex

                # All five names are tested, not just the two this script drives. Finding
                # Torrent, Reaper or Kite means the label works and the player is simply
                # parked on another stance, which is a switch. Finding none of the five
                # means the label does not carry the stance at all, and blind switching
                # would risk toggling the active stance off, so the feature stands down.
                if "Rake" in label__throwing_codex
                    @setvar! var__stance_active config__stance_rake
                elseif "Suppress" in label__throwing_codex
                    @setvar! var__stance_active config__stance_suppress
                elseif "Torrent" in label__throwing_codex
                    @setvar! var__stance_active config__stance_torrent
                elseif "Reaper" in label__throwing_codex
                    @setvar! var__stance_active config__stance_reaper
                elseif "Kite" in label__throwing_codex
                    @setvar! var__stance_active config__stance_kite
                else
                    @setvar! var__stance_disabled 1
                    overhead "No stance on codex label." 43
                endif

                if var__stance_disabled = 0 and var__stance_want != var__stance_active
                    if var__stance_want = 1
                        say "[ThrowingStance1"
                    elseif var__stance_want = 2
                        say "[ThrowingStance2"
                    elseif var__stance_want = 3
                        say "[ThrowingStance3"
                    elseif var__stance_want = 4
                        say "[ThrowingStance4"
                    elseif var__stance_want = 5
                        say "[ThrowingStance5"
                    endif

                    # Assume it took. Saying it again before the label catches up would risk
                    # toggling the stance straight back off.
                    @setvar! var__stance_active var__stance_want
                    settimer "timer__stance_resync" 0

                    if var__stance_want = config__stance_suppress
                        overhead "Suppress stance." 73
                    else
                        overhead "Rake stance." 73
                    endif
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # WEAPON ABILITY
    # ################################################################################
    # Clash, Blitz and Hail Mary share one gauge that refills in 24 to 60 seconds, so this
    # speaks at most once per cooldown__ability window. Distance picks between the two worth
    # using: Clash only pays inside 2 tiles, Blitz is the kiting one and makes every throw a
    # Moving Throw, which is exactly when Rake doubles. Hail Mary is left out because it
    # only pays beyond 9 tiles and that distance cannot be held.
    #
    # Driven by a cooldown rather than the "Weapon ability ready" message on purpose: a
    # wrong message string would stop the ability firing forever, a wrong cooldown only
    # shifts the timing.
    #
    # not pvp matters here. cooldown is on the Outlands PvP restriction list and it is the
    # only thing spacing these lines out, so a restricted cooldown would read 0 every pass
    # and turn this into chat spam. Timers are restricted too, so there is no second guard
    # to fall back on. This script is not a PvP script.
    if config__use_weapon_ability = 1 and not pvp and cooldown "Ability" = 0 and find var__combat_target ground -1 -1 12
        if find var__combat_target ground -1 -1 2
            @setvar! var__ability_want config__ability_clash
        else
            @setvar! var__ability_want config__ability_blitz
        endif

        if var__ability_want = 1
            say "[WeaponAbility1"
        elseif var__ability_want = 2
            say "[WeaponAbility2"
        elseif var__ability_want = 3
            say "[WeaponAbility3"
        endif

        if var__ability_want = config__ability_clash
            overhead "Clash ability." 73
        else
            overhead "Blitz ability." 73
        endif

        cooldown "Ability" cooldown__ability
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # BARD SONG BUFF
    # ################################################################################
    # The aspect resets the Music cooldown right after a song, so all three are tried in one pass.
    # No clearsysmsg in front of the blocks. See the buffer note in the file header.
    if config__use_bard_song = 1 and not targetexists and cooldown "Discord" = 0 and cooldown "Music" = 0 and not findbuff "song of discordance"
        useskill 'Discordance'
        waitfortarget wait__target

        if insysmsg "What instrument"
            target var__my_instrument
            replay
        elseif targetexists
            target backpack
        endif
    endif

    if config__use_bard_song = 1 and not targetexists and cooldown "Peace/Provo" = 0 and cooldown "Music" = 0 and not findbuff "song of provocation"
        useskill 'Provocation'
        waitfortarget wait__target

        if insysmsg "What instrument"
            target var__my_instrument
            replay
        elseif targetexists
            target backpack
        endif
    endif

    if config__use_bard_song = 1 and not targetexists and cooldown "Peace/Provo" = 0 and cooldown "Music" = 0 and not findbuff "song of peacemaking"
        useskill 'Peacemaking'
        waitfortarget wait__target

        if insysmsg "What instrument"
            target var__my_instrument
            replay
        elseif targetexists
            target backpack
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # PEACE
    # ################################################################################
    # Runs before DISCO so the target stops attacking first. A barding break is rolled once
    # per second against a pacified creature, not caused by your damage, so the pacify holds
    # through the fight and it is worth spending the first barding window on it.
    # The +25 effective skill for barding an already barded creature goes to whichever skill
    # lands second, so leading with peace costs nothing: DISCO collects it on the next pass.
    # No gate on the discord label. Peace has to be able to open on a fresh target, and the
    # shared Music cooldown already keeps the two from firing in the same pass.
    # The barding break label still gates: a broken creature is immune to peace for a while,
    # and DISCO runs instead, which is correct because discordance survives a break.
    if not warmode and not targetexists and find var__combat_target ground -1 -1 10 as alias__peace_target
        if skill "Peacemaking" > 0 and cooldown "Peace/Provo" = 0 and cooldown "Music" = 0
            getlabel alias__peace_target label__peace_target

            if "pacified" in label__peace_target or "barding break" in label__peace_target
                settimer "timer__combat_target_grace" 0
            else
                useskill 'Peacemaking'
                waitfortarget wait__target

                while targetexists
                    if insysmsg "What instrument shall you play"
                        target var__my_instrument
                        replay
                    endif

                    if dead alias__peace_target or var__combat_target != alias__peace_target
                        hotkey "Cancel Current Target"
                        wait wait__short
                    else
                        target alias__peace_target
                        wait wait__short
                    endif
                endwhile

                wait wait__short
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # DISCO
    # ################################################################################
    if not warmode and not targetexists and find var__combat_target ground -1 -1 10 as alias__disco_target
        if skill "Discordance" > 0 and cooldown "Discord" = 0 and cooldown "Music" = 0
            getlabel alias__disco_target label__disco_target

            if "discord" in label__disco_target
                settimer "timer__combat_target_grace" 0
            else
                useskill 'Discordance'
                waitfortarget wait__target

                while targetexists
                    if insysmsg "What instrument shall you play"
                        target var__my_instrument
                        replay
                    endif

                    if dead alias__disco_target or var__combat_target != alias__disco_target
                        hotkey "Cancel Current Target"
                        wait wait__short
                    else
                        target alias__disco_target
                        wait wait__short
                    endif
                endwhile

                wait wait__short
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # DISCO & VIRTUOSO
    # ################################################################################
    if not warmode and not targetexists and find var__combat_target ground -1 -1 10 as alias__virtuoso_target
        if skill "Discordance" > 0 and cooldown "Discord" = 0 and cooldown "Music" = 0 and not findbuff "Virtuoso"
            useskill 'Discordance'
            waitfortarget wait__target

            while targetexists
                if insysmsg "What instrument shall you play"
                    target var__my_instrument
                    replay
                endif

                if dead alias__virtuoso_target or var__combat_target != alias__virtuoso_target
                    hotkey "Cancel Current Target"
                    wait wait__short
                else
                    target alias__virtuoso_target
                    wait wait__short
                endif
            endwhile

            wait wait__short
        endif
    endif
endwhile
